// e1 - A lexical error
//
// The lexer (the first phase) reads characters and groups them into tokens.
// It reports characters that cannot start any token, numbers that are too
// large, and strings that never end. Compilation stops after this phase,
// so the parser never runs.

var price = 25
var total = price # 2
var huge = 99999999999999999999
println("total: ", total)
